graph TD
    subgraph "NGINX Cache Proxy"
        Users --> NGINX[Nginx Pod<br/>Cache Proxy]
        NGINX -->|Cache hit| Users
        NGINX -->|Cache miss| Backend[Origin Server]
        Backend -->|Store response| NGINX
        NGINX -->|Cache to disk| Disk[(Cache Disk or<br/>ephemeral volumes)]
        Users -->|Request 1| NGINX
        Users -->|Request 2<br/>same resource| NGINX
    end